<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 99,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 99,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog marketings were 99,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				    Country		   Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	     52.50 -53.50	  53.50 -54.50</p>
